{"id":"277139d18abb9838","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-omega-range-characterization.md","title":"相对左 c.e. 随机实数的 Omega 表示","display":"thm-omega-range-characterization — 相对左 c.e. 随机实数的 Omega 表示","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-omega-range-characterization","aliases":["43-thm-omega-range-characterization"],"display":"thm-omega-range-characterization — 相对左 c.e. 随机实数的 Omega 表示","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega-operator]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Corollary 18.3.4, equivalence of items 1 and 3","source_printed_pages":"558","source_pdf_pages":"578","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-omega-range-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-omega-range-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-range-characterization — 相对左 c.e. 随机实数的 Omega 表示"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Corollary 18.3.4, equivalence of items 1 and 3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"558"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"578"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in(0,1)\">\\(x\\in(0,1)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}\">\\(x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}^A\">\\(\\operatorname{Computable}^A\\)</span> 对有理函数使用固定有效编码，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U^A,\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}\">\\(\\Omega_U^A,\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)\\)</span> 是下式引入的辅助谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)\\iff\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Computable}^A(q)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;q(n)\\le q(n+1)\\land x=\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}q(n)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)\\iff\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Computable}^A(q)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;q(n)\\le q(n+1)\\land x=\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}q(n)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)\\right)\\iff\\exists U\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\land\\Omega_U^A=x\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)\\right)\\iff\\exists U\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\land\\Omega_U^A=x\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>表示必须由对所有 oracle 具有统一模拟前缀的通用机器给出。这里取 Corollary 18.3.4 的两项等价，避免仅为中间证明另引入相对 Solovay 归约。实数值与二进制序列已在 Hypothesis 绑定。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Corollary 18.3.4, equivalence of items 1 and 3，印刷页 558，PDF 页 578。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,X\\in2^\\omega$，$x\\in(0,1)$ 且 $x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}$。$\\operatorname{Computable}^A$ 对有理函数使用固定有效编码，见 [[43-df-computable]]；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]；$\\Omega_U^A,\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]。$\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)$ 是下式引入的辅助谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,X\\in2^\\omega$，$x\\in(0,1)$ 且 $x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}$。$\\operatorname{Computable}^A$ 对有理函数使用固定有效编码，见 [[43-df-computable]]；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]；$\\Omega_U^A,\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]。$\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)$ 是下式引入的辅助谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,X\\in2^\\omega$，$x\\in(0,1)$ 且 $x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}$。$\\operatorname{Computable}^A$ 对有理函数使用固定有效编码，见 [[43-df-computable]]；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]；$\\Omega_U^A,\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]。$\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)$ 是下式引入的辅助谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computable}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U^A,\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)\\iff\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Computable}^A(q)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;q(n)\\le q(n+1)\\land x=\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}q(n)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\operatorname{RelativeLeftCE}(A,x)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)\\right)\\iff\\exists U\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\land\\Omega_U^A=x\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2063,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-474","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-omega-range-characterization]] — 相对左 c.e. 随机实数的 Omega 表示"}],"outgoing":["0680931785133191","75e7e3b6eeecc95e","f357216a7edb035a"]}